    },
    {
      "id": "8o7ZEF62Rb1bYJkirNxGO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 328.5146484375,
      "y": 1629.265625,
      "width": 639.4995727539062,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aZ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 467570808,
      "version": 275,
      "versionNonce": 1847178001,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781937864356,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Deep Dives\nHow can we ensure that swiping is consistent and low latency\nSince we have choose cassndra\n\nRace condition\n1-> write -> A swipe yes for B \n2-> read -> is B swipe yes ? ( write is not propagte to all nodes)\n\n1-> write -> B swipe yes for A\n2- read -> is A swipe yes ? ( write is not propagte to all nodes) \n\nIn this case this match will be lost\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Deep Dives\nHow can we ensure that swiping is consistent and low latency\nSince we have choose cassndra\n\nRace condition\n1-> write -> A swipe yes for B \n2-> read -> is B swipe yes ? ( write is not propagte to all nodes)\n\n1-> write -> B swipe yes for A\n2- read -> is A swipe yes ? ( write is not propagte to all nodes) \n\nIn this case this match will be lost\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "PqCkhxStWLHVFWhueKd0-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 315.78812408447266,
      "y": 1987.326171875,
      "width": 749.3594360351562,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aa",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 577376273,
      "version": 476,
      "versionNonce": 787381695,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781939456337,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Solutions 1: Run a reconcile job to find the loss match\nSolutions 2: Use cache like Redis, to store the swipe\n\nSchema key (userid1_userid2).sort -> userid1_yes, userid2_no TTL-> 5 days\nAtomic transcation with reais feature\nPartation key key (userid1_userid2).sort\nTTL -> 5 days, not found in redis fallback cassandra\n\nDistributed transcation -> SAGA pattern, dual write, kafka\nSpace needed -> 10M * 100 * 5 -> 5B entries , should be fine\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Solutions 1: Run a reconcile job to find the loss match\nSolutions 2: Use cache like Redis, to store the swipe\n\nSchema key (userid1_userid2).sort -> userid1_yes, userid2_no TTL-> 5 days\nAtomic transcation with reais feature\nPartation key key (userid1_userid2).sort\nTTL -> 5 days, not found in redis fallback cassandra\n\nDistributed transcation -> SAGA pattern, dual write, kafka\nSpace needed -> 10M * 100 * 5 -> 5B entries , should be fine\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
