      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b00",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1974488113,
      "version": 419,
      "versionNonce": 873972351,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1782055282721,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Deep Dives\nHow can we ensure low latency for feed/stack generation\nSolutions 1 : Precompute from profile DB vai JOB\n\nLets use one of the SQL DB(Postgress) for the profile, and we can add the  PostGIS, extension to\neasily index the location data and search effectively\n\nWe can add another search engine like elastic search, which can help speed up the search.\nWhen something change in profile, we can recompute the stack cache for that user.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Deep Dives\nHow can we ensure low latency for feed/stack generation\nSolutions 1 : Precompute from profile DB vai JOB\n\nLets use one of the SQL DB(Postgress) for the profile, and we can add the  PostGIS, extension to\neasily index the location data and search effectively\n\nWe can add another search engine like elastic search, which can help speed up the search.\nWhen something change in profile, we can recompute the stack cache for that user.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
